INTERVIEW QUESTION 1
How do you set up GitHub Copilot in Visual Studio Code?
=======================================================

Interview Answer:

To set up GitHub Copilot in Visual Studio Code:

1. Open Visual Studio Code.

2. Open the Extensions Marketplace.

3. Search for "GitHub Copilot".

4. Install the GitHub Copilot extension.

5. Sign in with your GitHub account.

6. Authorize GitHub Copilot.

7. Enable the extension.

8. Start writing code or comments and GitHub Copilot will provide
   AI-powered suggestions.

