COMMON INTERVIEW TRAPS
======================

Q. Can GitHub Copilot be used without a GitHub account?

Answer:

No.

A GitHub account is required to authenticate and use GitHub Copilot.

---

Q. Does installing the extension automatically enable Copilot?

Answer:

No.

You must sign in with your GitHub account and authorize Copilot before
using it.

---

Q. Does GitHub Copilot only work in VS Code?

Answer:

No.

It also supports Visual Studio, IntelliJ IDEA, Eclipse, Neovim,
and several other IDEs.

